      "value": "Vaguely quoting vrchat here: public, friends and friends+ are all considered public instances. \n\nSo unless you are in invite or invite+ there will always be opportunity to see exactly where you are in game and the ability to join on you especially because you can currently always get the instance that a friend is in unless they are in a private world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
