      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: well I mean, Friends and Friends+ exist. and if a friend is in friends only, then fine, but sometimes you want to join on a friend in a friends only capacity. Im not gonna join on a friend and suddenly have him and his group all migrate to a new world just to make a Friends only.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
