      "value": "@{5b68fbeec52d7b606b4182ec|full_name}: I understand the request and the solution would be hiding the current instance that you are in when your status is red. I am just pointing out the reason its not currently available and might never be, because API wise those instances are pretty much considered public in every way.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
